<p><em>Montana State University</em><br />Strand Union Building 183<br />P.O. Box 172260<br />Bozeman, MT 59717-2260</p>
<p>Monday-Friday, 8:00 AM-5:00 PM (MST)</p>
<p>Contact: <br />+1 (406) 994-4031<br />WhatsApp: +1 (406) 589-8600<br /><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#5f3833303d3e332c2b2a3b261f3230312b3e313e713a3b2a"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="9ef9f2f1fcfff2edeaebfae7def3f1f0eafff0ffb0fbfaeb">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> <br />24-Hour Emergency Number: <br />+1 (406) 994-2121</p>
<p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/MontanaStateInternationalStudents/"><img style="vertical-align: middle;" src="/international/admissions/images/Facebook%20Icon.png" alt="Facebook" width="24" height="24" /></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/internationalmsu/"><img style="vertical-align: middle;" src="/international/admissions/images/Instagram%20Icon.png" alt="Instagram" width="24" height="24" /></a>&nbsp;</p>
